{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-11",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "池沢より上に行きたいか  (Do You Want to Surpass Ikezawa?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "furuya": "古谷",
    "takei": "武井",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in Tokyo, Furuya gives Toshi a peek at a secret underground tape warehouse—right before Detective Takei leads a sudden police raid on Fujiwara's operation. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "客にあれを見せたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あれ、これ池沢んとこの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "表が売れりゃあ売れるほど、裏も売れるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "しかも売り上げは圧倒的にこっちのほうが上だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "まだ俺眠いんだよ。はい、摘発。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "おい、藤原。客がいない時にやれよ。座れ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "ここで働いてるのは全員外国人なんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "どうしてですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "強制送還の金がかかるだけで、何の見せしめにもならないだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "なあ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "池沢より上に行きたいか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "客にあれを見せたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to show our guest that room.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あれ、これ池沢んとこの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, is this Ikezawa's stuff?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "表が売れりゃあ売れるほど、裏も売れるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The more legitimate tapes sell above ground, the more underground copies sell too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "しかも売り上げは圧倒的にこっちのほうが上だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's more, revenue on this side is overwhelmingly higher.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "まだ俺眠いんだよ。はい、摘発。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm still sleepy here. Alright, this is a bust.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "おい、藤原。客がいない時にやれよ。座れ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, Fujiwara. Save the rough stuff for when we don't have a guest. Sit down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "ここで働いてるのは全員外国人なんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone working in this place is a foreign laborer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "どうしてですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "強制送還の金がかかるだけで、何の見せしめにもならないだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Deporting them just costs money and doesn't serve as an example to anyone, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "なあ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Say, Toshi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "池沢より上に行きたいか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you want to climb higher than Ikezawa?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "客にあれを見せたい。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
